<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Commercial Gaps Review | Arrington Consultancy</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        :root {
            <% for (const [prop, val] of Object.entries(theme.vars)) { %>
            <%= prop %>: <%= val %>;
            <% } %>
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--black); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }
        header { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
        header img { height: 32px; width: auto; }
        header .cgr-back-link { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
        main { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 6rem; }
        .cgr-label { font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-bright); line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 1rem; text-wrap: balance; }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4.5vw, 2.2rem); }
        h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; }
        p { color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 1.2rem; }

        .cgr-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .cgr-card-label { font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .cgr-primary { border-color: var(--accent); }

        .cgr-resource { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
        .cgr-resource a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
        .cgr-resource a:hover, .cgr-resource a:focus-visible { text-decoration: underline; }

        .btn { display: inline-block; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 3px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid transparent; }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--accent); }
        .btn-primary:hover, .btn-primary:focus-visible { background: var(--accent-hover); border-color: var(--accent-hover); }
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--text-bright); border-color: var(--border); }
        .btn-outline:hover, .btn-outline:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

        .cgr-next { text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 3rem 0 1rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
        .cgr-next p { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 1.75rem; }

        .cgr-caveat { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .cgr-card .cgr-label { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .cgr-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <a href="/" aria-label="Arrington Consultancy home"><img src="/img/logo" alt="Arrington Business Consultancy"></a>
        <a href="/" class="cgr-back-link">&larr; Back to site</a>
    </header>

    <main>
        <p class="cgr-label">YOUR COMMERCIAL GAPS REVIEW</p>
        <h1><%= headline %></h1>
        <p><%= visitorSummary %></p>

        <div class="cgr-card">
            <p class="cgr-label">AI-generated, not personally reviewed</p>
            <p>What follows was generated by Arrington Consultancy's AI commercial review system, based only on what you wrote. Tom Arrington has not personally read or checked this specific result.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cgr-card cgr-primary">
            <p class="cgr-card-label">Primary issue</p>
            <p><%= primaryIssue %></p>
        </div>

        <div class="cgr-card">
            <p class="cgr-card-label">Also worth watching</p>
            <p><%= secondaryIssue %></p>
        </div>

        <div class="cgr-card">
            <p class="cgr-card-label">One useful observation</p>
            <p><%= usefulObservation %></p>
        </div>

        <div class="cgr-card cgr-resource">
            <p class="cgr-card-label">Worth reading</p>
            <a href="<%= recommendedResource.url %>"><%= recommendedResource.title %></a>
            <p><%= recommendedResource.reason %></p>
        </div>

        <p class="cgr-caveat">This review is a starting point, not a finished answer. It has looked at what you told us and pointed at where the pressure seems to be, it has not solved it for you.</p>

        <div class="cgr-next">
            <h2>If this sounds familiar</h2>
            <p>A straightforward conversation is usually enough to work out whether a proper commercial review would help.</p>
            <a href="/book-a-30-minute-conversation" class="btn btn-primary">Book a 30 minute conversation</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
